What's wrong:
The SendMailService.checkAssessmentEmails() method constructs a raw SQL query using string interpolation with user-controlled deliveryDate data. Although the query is partially parameterized, the entire WHERE clause is built as a raw string without proper parameterization, exposing the application to SQL injection.

